<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Supplementary Material</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This supplement documents (i) the complete hyperparameter manifest of the
released codebase, (ii) verbatim VLM prompt templates, (iii) the per-agent
decision loop in pseudocode, (iv) extended per-modality, per-failure-mode,
step-distribution, and statistical-test results referenced in the body,
(v) the DistGate edge case underlying the transparent-object failure
floor, (vi) the wall-clock and per-stage VLM compute profile, and
(vii) the real-world heterogeneous-swarm deployment configuration.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Implementation Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Hyperparameter manifest</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All values below are extracted from the released codebase
(<a href="https://anonymous.4open.science/r/anygoal-B855/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://anonymous.4open.science/r/anygoal-B855/</a>) with the
file:line where each constant is defined. “Provenance” distinguishes
values inherited from the upstream UCB-frontier reference
implementation from values specific to this work and from values
mandated by the GOAT-Bench protocol.</p>
</div>
