</section>
<section id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Compute breakdown.</h5>

<div id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Extrapolating the seed-2 VLM time to the full <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="360" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>360</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">360</annotation></semantics></math>-episode budget
yields a per-episode VLM overhead of <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx\!58\,\mathrm{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>58</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx\!58\,\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, totalling
<math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx\!5.8\,\mathrm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>5.8</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx\!5.8\,\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, or <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx\!4\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx\!4\%</annotation></semantics></math> of the <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="145.8\,\mathrm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>145.8</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">145.8\,\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math>
headline wall clock. SAM3 detector inference is logged at the
server-side terminal (<span id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">utils/sam3_server.py:207</span>) but is not
written to a file; we therefore report SAM3 timing as unmeasured. The
remaining <math id="A6.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!96\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>96</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!96\%</annotation></semantics></math> of wall-clock is consumed by the Habitat
simulator, the FMM planner, and tensor-level mapping updates, none of
which are individually profiled in the current code. The seed-2
latency profile is reproducible from the released log files.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Real-World Heterogeneous Deployment</h2>

<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Platform.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The real-world swarm comprises a Unitree Go1 quadruped (single-agent
validation) with the same software stack ported to ROS2 in the
<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hetspace-ros2</span> repository. Per-robot compute is an NVIDIA
Jetson AGX Orin; the sensor is an Intel RealSense D455 RGB-D camera
streamed at <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="424\!\times\!240\!@\!15\,\mathrm{fps}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.052em">×</mo><mrow><mi>@</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>15</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>fps</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">424\!\times\!240\!@\!15\,\mathrm{fps}</annotation></semantics></math> with GPU-accelerated
GLSL pipeline (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">realsense-ros</span> patched to disable a depth
rotation filter that produced artefacts at the D455 mounting
orientation). Ground-truth pose is supplied by a Vicon
motion-capture rig at <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="192.168.50.74" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>192.168.50.74</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">192.168.50.74</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Mapping.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The local occupancy/value map is <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="12\!\times\!12\,\mathrm{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">12\!\times\!12\,\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math> at
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.05\,\mathrm{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.05\,\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math>/cell (<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="240\!\times\!240" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>240</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">240\!\times\!240</annotation></semantics></math> grid, world origin
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[-6.0,-6.0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6.0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[-6.0,-6.0]</annotation></semantics></math>), updated at <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\,\mathrm{Hz}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Hz</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\,\mathrm{Hz}</annotation></semantics></math> over depth-downsampled
inputs (effective <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="212\!\times\!120" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">212\!\times\!120</annotation></semantics></math> projection). Log-odds occupancy
uses <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{occ}}=0.7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mtext>occ</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{occ}}=0.7</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{free}}=-0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{free}}=-0.2</annotation></semantics></math>, clipped to
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[-3.0,3.5]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3.0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>3.5</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[-3.0,3.5]</annotation></semantics></math> with a publish threshold of <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.5</annotation></semantics></math>
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">mapper_params.yaml:15--40</span>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Onboard perception.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The heavy SAM3+SpaceOM cloud stack is replaced by a fully onboard
combination of YOLO-World (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">yolov8s-worldv2.pt</span>) with MobileSAM
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">mobile_sam.pt</span>); YOLO confidence threshold <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.4</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.4</annotation></semantics></math>, IoU
threshold <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.5</annotation></semantics></math>, minimum mask area <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="100\,\mathrm{px}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>px</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">100\,\mathrm{px}</annotation></semantics></math>
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">mapper_params.yaml:29--31, 49--50</span>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Navigation.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The deployed FMM planner uses a <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5</annotation></semantics></math>-cell step (<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\sim}0.25\,\mathrm{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\sim}0.25\,\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math>,
matching the simulator), <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.32\,\mathrm{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.32</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.32\,\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math> robot radius for the Go1
(<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="290\,\mathrm{mm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>290</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>mm</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">290\,\mathrm{mm}</annotation></semantics></math> half-width plus <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="30\,\mathrm{mm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>mm</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30\,\mathrm{mm}</annotation></semantics></math> margin), and a
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.0\,\mathrm{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.0\,\mathrm{m}</annotation></semantics></math> stop distance identical to the simulator success
radius. Each episode is capped at <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="300" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>300</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">300</annotation></semantics></math> discrete actions or
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="600\,\mathrm{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">600\,\mathrm{s}</annotation></semantics></math>, whichever comes first. The VLM perception gate
threshold is set to <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.60</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.60</annotation></semantics></math> on the real robot
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">nav_params.yaml:41</span>) versus <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.50</annotation></semantics></math> in simulation; the higher
threshold reduces false stops on the noisier onboard detector. The
VLM server runs remotely at <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="192.168.50.185\!:\!8008" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>8008</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">192.168.50.185\!:\!8008</annotation></semantics></math> with a <math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="20\,\text{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">20\,\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math>
HTTP timeout (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">nav_params.yaml:8</span>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Inter-node communication.</h5>

<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All inter-node traffic uses ROS2 topics and services (not the ZMQ
detector-server channel used in simulation). Key interfaces:
<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/cmd_vel</span> (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">geometry_msgs/Twist</span>) from controller to
<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">unitree_ros</span>; <span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/cmd/discrete_action</span>
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hetspace_discrete_ctrl/DiscreteCmd</span>) from navigation to
controller; <span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/map/occupancy</span>
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">nav_msgs/OccupancyGrid</span>) from mapping to navigation;
<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/map/targets</span> (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">visualization_msgs/MarkerArray</span>) from
mapping to navigation; <span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/vlm/query</span>
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">hetspace_nav/VLMQuery</span>) from navigation to the VLM client;
and <span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/vicon/unitree/…</span> (<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">geometry_msgs/PoseStamped</span>
<math id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>+</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">nav_msgs/Odometry</span>) from the Vicon bridge to all nodes.
Per-call VLM latency is logged on the client
(<span id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">vlm_client_node.py:70, 95, 103, 109, 122</span>); aggregated
on-robot timing is intentionally deferred to the camera-ready deployment writeup.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section><div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:creator" content="Anonymous Submission"></div>
